{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0043_1000_p", "source_sha256": "3659e123f705a75c85c37092ee14756f2d9b09db0574cc17faa509ac50ae743b", "ja": "（ライブの後、麗花に屋台を見たいと頼まれて、\nここで待ち合わせをしているんだけど……遅いな）", "zh": "（演唱会后，丽花说想去逛摊贩，\n所以我正在等她……不过她好慢啊。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0043_1001_048rei", "source_sha256": "517330200c1131ea5bb8b64764968695eac6d3a8e571428585dcef4c408d7c2b", "ja": "迷子の迷子の{$P$}さーん！\n……あ！　あそこにいる地味目な人は……。", "zh": "走失的{$P$}先生～！\n……啊！那边有个不起眼的人……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0043_1002_048rei", "source_sha256": "84d7f7f5254bbdd5b369b68e10533a78a2f1622d59c8a5070a2ee1b95fe33d96", "ja": "やっぱり、{$P$}さんでした！\n探しちゃいましたよ～、こんなところにいたんですね♪", "zh": "果然就是{$P$}先生！\n我找了好久～原来你在这里啊♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0043_1003_p", "source_sha256": "0057eb6cf5a962221f15019fb257d4bfbcd2898e2802a82874b2c77bcf2041d0", "ja": "いや、麗花に指定された場所なんだが……。\n何はともあれ、お疲れさま。ライブ、よかったぞ。", "zh": "等等，丽花，是你要我在这里等的啊……\n算了，不管怎样，辛苦你了。演唱会很棒喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0043_1004_048rei", "source_sha256": "2d07b7d8b5c4ff16925c7c277009399cf366a2d28114e09a31cca45f5ff54eaf", "ja": "はい♪　私も、とーっても面白かったです！\nあっ、それでですね！", "zh": "谢谢♪我也玩得很开心喔！\n啊，对了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0043_1005_048rei", "source_sha256": "f66640b414fd0e911664970ea360770a33f2806377ea1f4e3fbcdb45e4a7aa6f", "ja": "神社の神主さんに、お土産もらっちゃったんです。\nなんだと思いますか？　{$P$}さん。", "zh": "神社的神主有送我礼物喔。\n你猜是什么呢？{$P$}先生～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0043_1006_p", "source_sha256": "b4c3d2cc319e66f655cc1732f23a32b966ff3c239a256d3f47ad4757ece46da9", "ja": "神主さんのお土産か……なんだろうな？", "zh": "神主送的礼物吗……是什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0043_1007_048rei", "source_sha256": "53947839d143ca85233b2322089833e54899e39792945b7d8722487e38d5c59e", "ja": "ヒントは、おしるこです！", "zh": "提示是──红豆汤！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0043_1008", "source_sha256": "6a607652130a822464334ceb7cc94031c05c840f245d026a68a5325ce3a394c0", "ja": "おしるこ！", "zh": "红豆汤！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0043_2000_p", "source_sha256": "8112d76011a01fc3d8f752a40b45dd5146c238ec34bacba170bea4284e77d63c", "ja": "じゃあ、おしるこ！", "zh": "那我就猜红豆汤！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0043_2001_048rei", "source_sha256": "9b700b2b7478d18c394d0305f6bd6c6fcb1c1550603d5966260592ecb6240ac4", "ja": "残念！　おみくじでした！\nこれ、{$P$}さんの分です♪", "zh": "答错了！是签诗喔！\n这是{$P$}先生的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0043_2002_p", "source_sha256": "dbc2e218fa096e8f5791eb543b4ebb2c2ad160230c5e8f06c023caf586ef8505", "ja": "（どこがヒントだったんだろう……）", "zh": "（这算哪门子的提示……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0043_2003_048rei", "source_sha256": "b3c36fbfa642505e6f056421277ab9962a410240bb696d14ca4285cbf021a787", "ja": "大吉かな？　それとも中吉？\nうふふ、開けるのが楽しみですね！", "zh": "是大吉吗？还是中吉呢？\n呵呵，真期待打开会是什么！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0043_2004_048rei", "source_sha256": "27eb15ecbf308f06adced450da552bd10a8d37d1190d8012b22ff46a4c78d6fb", "ja": "でも、{$P$}さんのことは、\nさっき私達が、たくさんはむはむしてあげましたから。", "zh": "不过，刚刚我们舞狮时\n已经咬过{$P$}先生很多下了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0043_2005_048rei", "source_sha256": "8bf0e7d703a51538546476def836cb5ed5669d1488362e15065b0f89c179cd2e", "ja": "きっと、どんな運勢でも大丈夫です！\nバッチリですよ！", "zh": "不管抽到什么运势，肯定都没问题的！\n不用担心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0043_2006_p", "source_sha256": "8d6270ad8418f921bcd4cdf5cb58cab35e803f81abfb8cc2b2c2f5cc6ceb0ba1", "ja": "うん、そうだな。よし、さっそく見てみようか。\nどれどれ……末吉か。はは、確かに普通だな。", "zh": "嗯，说得也是。好，赶快打开吧。\n我看看……是末吉呀。哈哈，的确很普通呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0043_2007_048rei", "source_sha256": "29eca19bbeb44cd1be0ab9da1087496a77f6b887dc51023733e2f29197eddb70", "ja": "わぁ、素敵♪　さすが{$P$}さん、\nほれぼれするくらい普通ですね！", "zh": "哇～好棒喔♪不愧是{$P$}先生，\n普通到令人着迷呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0043_2008_048rei", "source_sha256": "b1f882956c85a54a64df861c0ac35eef5e9af3c45bfbf2444af97ae38d09d052", "ja": "新年も、{$P$}さんと一緒なら、\n楽しいことがいっぱいありそうです！　ふふっ♪", "zh": "和{$P$}先生一起度过新年，\n感觉也会发生很多开心的事呢！呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
